╭─ Context Retrieval Agent (Model response (API selection)) ─────────╮
│ Okay, let's analyze the issue and craft a strategy to gather more  │
│ context using the available APIs. The core problem is that __str__ │
│ on a TextChoices or IntegerChoices field returns the string        │
│ representation of the choice, not the underlying value. This       │
│ discrepancy causes issues when communicating with external APIs.   │
│                                                                    │
│ Here's a breakdown of the steps and the API calls I'll use:        │
│                                                                    │
│  1 Understand the MyChoice enum: We need to see how MyChoice is    │
│    defined and how its __str__ method is implemented.              │
│     • API: search_class(class_name="MyChoice")                     │
